== Classification of the interface

.Instructions
[%collapsible]
=====
[NOTE]
====
Interfaces are classified automatically based on the threat model. To review this section:

. Check that the interface has been correctly classified as an external interface or internal interface. If not, then improve the dataflows of threat model. External interfaces have dataflows from external entities or persons.
. Check that the relationship of this interface to the trust boundaries have been correctly classified. If not, then improve the dataflows and trust boundaries of the threat model.
====
